			<item>
				<title>001 Dream as Calling</title>
				<link>http://localhost:1313/en/docs/pivtorak-studio/001-dream-as-calling/</link>
				<pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>http://localhost:1313/en/docs/pivtorak-studio/001-dream-as-calling/</guid>
				<description>&lt;div class=&#34;float-right&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/pivtorak-studio-01.webp&#34; alt=&#34;Dream as Calling&#34; /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;h1 id=&#34;-dream-as-calling&#34;&gt;🕊️ Dream as Calling&lt;a class=&#34;anchor&#34; href=&#34;#-dream-as-calling&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;When you are reminded that you have a Calling.&lt;/em&gt; &lt;br&gt;&#xA;&lt;strong&gt;16.07.2023.&lt;/strong&gt; A white background. Silence. &lt;br&gt;&#xA;And a dove — large, weightless, like an air-filled figure. &lt;br&gt;&#xA;In the dream, it didn’t just appear — it touched me. &lt;br&gt;&#xA;It was a sign. A touch. A presence of support. &lt;br&gt;&#xA;I was reminded that I have a Calling. &lt;br&gt;&#xA;Not for the first time. But this time — undeniably. &lt;br&gt;&#xA;No doubts, no explanations, no rush. &lt;br&gt;&#xA;Just — yes. &lt;br&gt;&#xA;Just — here. &lt;br&gt;&#xA;After that, I acted fast. &lt;br&gt;&#xA;Intuitively — with precision. &lt;br&gt;&#xA;Each step was attuned. &lt;br&gt;&#xA;And today, when all this has become part of a system, &lt;br&gt;&#xA;I remember: &lt;br&gt;&#xA;this Calling didn’t come from my mind. &lt;br&gt;&#xA;It came from above. &lt;br&gt;&#xA;Through the dove. &lt;br&gt;&#xA;And through Love. &lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title>002 On the Red Carpet</title>
				<link>http://localhost:1313/en/docs/pivtorak-studio/002-on-the-red-carpet/</link>
				<pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>http://localhost:1313/en/docs/pivtorak-studio/002-on-the-red-carpet/</guid>
				<description>&lt;div class=&#34;float-right&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/pivtorak-studio-02.webp&#34; alt=&#34;On the Red Carpet&#34; /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;-on-the-red-carpet&#34;&gt;🟥 On the Red Carpet &lt;br&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;anchor&#34; href=&#34;#-on-the-red-carpet&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;My path — is already here.&lt;/em&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;19.07.2023.&lt;/strong&gt; This isn’t cinema. Not Cannes. Not someone else’s applause.&lt;br&gt;&#xA;This is my carpet.&lt;br&gt;&#xA;And I stepped onto it myself. &lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;No stage. No script.&lt;br&gt;&#xA;And no obligation to remain in systems that no longer fit me. &lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The story has already begun. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;I am already walking. &lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Not on pavement — on a carpet&lt;br&gt;&#xA;that recognizes my step. &lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title>003 The Presence</title>
				<link>http://localhost:1313/en/docs/pivtorak-studio/003-the-presence/</link>
				<pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>http://localhost:1313/en/docs/pivtorak-studio/003-the-presence/</guid>
				<description>&lt;div class=&#34;float-right&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/pivtorak-studio-03.webp&#34; alt=&#34;The Presence&#34; /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;h1 id=&#34;-the-presence&#34;&gt;📍 The Presence&lt;a class=&#34;anchor&#34; href=&#34;#-the-presence&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The formula is already at work.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;10.08.2023.&lt;/strong&gt; I didn’t just walk away from different systems.&lt;br&gt;&#xA;I created my own.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;And now every action happens within a new reality.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;I saw the structure.&lt;br&gt;&#xA;And I didn’t name it after myself —&lt;br&gt;&#xA;I called it what it truly is:&lt;br&gt;&#xA;&lt;strong&gt;Pivtorak.Studio&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;It’s not a brand. Not a role.&lt;br&gt;&#xA;&lt;em&gt;It is the architecture of value explosion.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;A system activated from within.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
